            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " koloma neejai aditot naka okoku loka Kinom, naejai eiduny neelomarere orute loka Atiboloka, kitatam kaŋina akiro nukalimokini jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinera ebe, ‘Kopuputu yesi akirot naka EJAKAIT, yes ikabakan luka Yuda, ka luibojete koYerusalem. Ebala kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio, Edeke loka Isirael ebe, Koany, ayauni aronis aibois na, naisideloori aki nuka ninitunanan yeniirari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
